+ 153 = 403\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the total number of cake-eating days observed by the end of 2016 is \\(\\boxed{403}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{403}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"prealgebra:171"}
